      393       for each old-c-plc-hist no-lock
      394       on error undo, return error substitute( "&1. &2&3&4", vss-workfile, return-value, chr(10), error-status :get-message ( 1 ) )
      395       :
      396         if old-c-plc-hist.subject = 'pl-gds':U
